ents.• Wrote clean, reusable, and functional code for optimal web application performance.• Utilized Redux for state management and Git for version control.• Assisted in bug fixes and code optimization to enhance the functionality of applications.🎓Education:• B.Sc. Information Technology• Madura College, [2021]",
